# ============================================
# GCP API Examples - Medical Report Processing
# ============================================
###

### Example: Full Medical Report OCR + Translation Pipeline
# Step 1: Analyze document with Vision API
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gcp/vision/analyze-document
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "imageBase64": "{{imageBase64}}",
  "languageHints": ["bn", "en"]
}

### Step 2: Extract and translate medical terms
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/gcp/translate/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "texts": [
    "রক্তচাপ",
    "হিমোগ্লোবিন"
  ],
  "sourceLanguage": "bn",
  "targetLanguage": "en"
}

###
# ============================================
# Notes:
# ============================================
# 
# GCP Vision API Endpoints:
# - /api/gcp/vision/detect-text           - Simple text extraction
# - /api/gcp/vision/analyze-document      - Full OCR with blocks/paragraphs/words
# - /api/gcp/vision/validate-image        - Pre-flight image quality check
#
# GCP Translation API Endpoints:
# - /api/gcp/translate/translate          - Single text translation
# - /api/gcp/translate/batch              - Batch translation (up to 100 texts)
# - /api/gcp/translate/detect-language    - Language detection
#
# Language Hints:
# - bn  = Bangla/Bengali
# - en  = English
# - hi  = Hindi
# - null = Auto-detect
#
# Configuration:
# - Ensure application is running with GCP profile:
#   ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=local2,gcp'
# - GCP credentials must be configured in application-gcp.properties
# - Vision API and Translation API must be enabled in GCP project
###
